/*
 * Sweep glossary — one name per thing (EN / FR / ES). Use these everywhere: menus, titles, buttons, search, help, notifications.
 *   Today            / Aujourd'hui            / Hoy                 (was Overview / Aperçu / Resumen)
 *   Stats            / Stats                  / Stats               (was Insights / Analyses / Análisis)
 *   Subscription     / Abonnement             / Suscripción         (was Plan & billing / Forfait). « Plan » = only the plan of the day.
 *   Daily review     / Revue du jour          / Revisión del día    (was 60-second review)
 *   Weekly recap     / Bilan de la semaine    / Resumen semanal     (the Friday ritual: recap, Edge Reveal, chest)
 *   Week             / Semaine                / Semana              (the week view inside Journal)
 *   Journal          / Journal                / Diario              (a segment of Trades; acting on a trade = Log / Journaliser / Registrar)
 *   Accounts · Payouts & expenses / Comptes · Payouts et dépenses / Cuentas · Payouts y gastos
 *   Progression      / Progression            / Progreso
 */
